  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2772564d-40da-416b-a79b-b693627599c3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"235\"></p><p>這是一個讓 Mizuno 與 <strong><em>Frights Delight</em><em>.</em></strong> 相容的材質包。<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>必備模組：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frights-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frights Delight</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>我所有的 Mizuno 附加包。<br></strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno Better Leaves</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unofficial Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Connected Texture</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Fresh Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Dark Mode</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Connected Glass</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Eating Animation</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Better Grass</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-copper-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Copper Tools</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-allay-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Allay Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's Chicken Variants</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's Chicken Variants x FA</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-fox-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Fox Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Cow Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Cow Variants x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Pig Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Pig Variants x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforg